{"product_id":"pampanga-dragon-001","title":"Dragon - X002 (Butt only)","description":"\u003cp class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"\u003eA striking blend of traditional craftsmanship and premium exotic materials, this handcrafted custom cue is designed for players and collectors who appreciate elegance, precision, and exceptional detail. The cue features a stunning hand-inlaid dragon motif crafted from genuine Mother of Pearl and Abalone, creating a captivating centerpiece that reflects beautifully under any lighting.\u003cspan class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBuilt with a rich \u003cstrong\u003eEbony wood handle\u003c\/strong\u003e for a solid, balanced feel, and complemented by a beautifully figured \u003cstrong\u003eWenge wood forearm and butt sleeve\u003c\/strong\u003e, this cue offers both timeless aesthetics and outstanding performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLength:\u003c\/strong\u003e 29.5 inches\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 19 oz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePin:\u003c\/strong\u003e Radial 3\/8 × 8\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eForearm:\u003c\/strong\u003e Wenge Wood\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHandle:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ebony Wood\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eButt Sleeve:\u003c\/strong\u003e Wenge Wood\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eInlays:\u003c\/strong\u003e Genuine Mother of Pearl \u0026amp; Abalone Dragon Inlay\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43439507963952,"sku":null,"price":40000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0697\/4878\/5200\/files\/ChatGPTImageJul28_2026_04_08_28PM.png?v=17852